{"title": "Toronto Street Festival Shooting Leaves 2 Dead, 3 Wounded", "summary": "A mass shooting incident occurred near a Toronto street festival, resulting in the deaths of two people and injuries to three others. Police have warned of an active shooter and are searching for the attacker. The incident has raised concerns about public safety at outdoor events.", "summary_points": ["A mass shooting incident occurred near a Toronto street festival", "Two people were killed and three others wounded in the incident", "Police have warned of an active shooter and are searching for the attacker", "The incident has raised concerns about public safety at outdoor events", "The police have secured the scene, but the investigation is ongoing"], "title_hi": "टोरंटो स्ट्रीट फेस्टिवल शूटिंग में 2 लोगों की मौत हुई, 3 घायल हुए", "summary_hi": "टोरंटो स्ट्रीट फेस्टिवल में एक बड़े गोलीबारी मामले में दो लोगों की मौत हुई और तीन अन्य घायल हुए। पुलिस ने एक सक्रिय शूटर की तलाश शुरू कर दी है और घटना के बाद से सुरक्षा बढ़ाई है।", "summary_points_hi": ["टोरंटो स्ट्रीट फेस्टिवल में एक बड़े गोलीबारी मामले में दो लोगों की मौत हुई", "दो लोगों की मौत हुई और तीन अन्य घायल हुए इस घटना में", "पुलिस ने एक सक्रिय शूटर की तलाश शुरू कर दी है और घटना के बाद से सुरक्षा बढ़ाई है", "इस घटना ने सार्वजनिक सुरक्षा पर ध्यान आकर्षित किया है", "पुलिस ने घटनास्थल को सुरक्षित कर लिया है, लेकिन अभी भी जांच जारी है"], "framing": {"left": ["Left-leaning outlets emphasize the need for increased security measures at public events and highlight the importance of addressing gun violence in Canada. They also mention the potential impact on Indian communities who may be affected by such incidents."], "center": ["Centrist coverage focuses on the immediate response of the police, the number of casualties, and the ongoing investigation. It provides a balanced view of the incident without taking a strong stance on the issue."], "right": ["Right-leaning outlets focus on the attacker's identity and motivations, as well as the potential for terrorism or radicalization. They also mention the need for stricter gun control laws in Canada."]}, "framing_hi": {"left": ["वामपंथी समाचार एजेंसियां सुरक्षा उपायों को बढ़ाने और कनाडा में हिंसा को कम करने पर जोर देती हैं। वे इस घटना के प्रभाव के लिए भारतीय समुदायों पर ध्यान आकर्षित करते हैं।"], "center": ["केंद्रीय समाचार एजेंसियां घटनास्थल पर पुलिस की तेज़ प्रतिक्रिया, घायलों की संख्या और जांच में लगे रहित हैं। वे इस घटना को एक संतुलित दृष्टिकोण प्रदान करते हैं बिना किसी भी पक्ष की ओर झुकने।"], "right": ["दाहिनी समाचार एजेंसियां हमलावर की पहचान और मोटिवेशन पर ध्यान केंद्रित करती हैं, साथ ही कनाडा में अधिक सख्त हथियार नियंत्रण के प्रस्तावों पर भी।"]}, "topic": "International", "region": "World", "published_at": null, "image_url": "https://th-i.thgim.com/public/incoming/a0x526/article71212980.ece/alternates/LANDSCAPE_1200/2026-07-12T014545Z_1856486480_RC20CMA6YCJD_RTRMADP_3_CANADA-TORONTO-SHOOTING.JPG", "sources": [{"source": "The Hindu", "owner": "The Hindu Group", "lean": "left", "language": "en", "url": "https://www.thehindu.com/news/international/toronto-salsa-street-festival-shooting-death-injuries-july-2026/article71212979.ece", "headline": "2 dead and 3 wounded in shooting near Toronto street festival, police say"}, {"source": "The Times of India", "owner": "Times Group", "lean": "center", "language": "en", "url": "https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/canada-toronto-shooting-leaves-2-dead-5-injured-attacker-at-large/articleshow/132339772.cms", "headline": "Canada: Toronto shooting leaves 2 dead, 5 injured; attacker at large"}, {"source": "Mint", "owner": "HT Media", "lean": "center", "language": "en", "url": "https://www.livemint.com/news/world/canada-mass-shooting-news-latin-street-festival-toronto-death-toll-11783820412513.html", "headline": "At least two dead, several others wounded in mass shooting in Canada's Latin street festival: Here's what we know"}, {"source": "Aaj Tak", "owner": "India Today Group", "lean": "right", "